<view class="page badges-page">
  <view class="badge-hero">
    <view class="badge-hero__eyebrow">记录成就</view>
    <view class="badge-hero__title">{{unlockedCount}} 枚勋章已解锁</view>
    <view class="badge-hero__text">勋章仅根据打卡记录自动展示，无积分、无兑换，也不代表健康效果。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="badge-grid">
    <view class="badge-card {{item.unlocked ? '' : 'badge-card--locked'}}" wx:for="{{badges}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="badge-medal badge-medal--{{item.theme}} {{item.unlocked ? '' : 'badge-medal--locked'}}">
        {{item.symbol}}
      </view>
      <view class="badge-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="badge-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
      <view class="badge-progress">
        <view class="badge-progress__bar" style="width: {{item.progress}}%;"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="tiny muted">{{item.unlocked ? '已解锁' : item.progressText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer">连续打卡仅用于鼓励记录习惯，中断记录不会产生任何健康评价。请根据自身情况合理安排使用。</view>
</view>
